  "dcterms:title": "ADReCS - Adverse Drug Reaction Classification System (v3.3)",
  "dcterms:description": "ADReCS is an ontology database for standardization and hierarchical classification of adverse drug reaction (ADR) terms, with drug information, ADR terminology, drug-ADR interactions, severity grades, frequencies and quantitative features. This brick packages ADReCS v3.3 files downloaded from bioinf.xmu.edu.cn/ADReCS (Bioinformatics-Aided Drug Discovery Group, Xiamen University). ADReCS integrates data from FAERS, DailyMed, CVAROD, SIDER 4.1, MedDRA, DrugBank and PubChem.",
