  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by licensing-provenance annotation agent (Claude). Upstream confirmed from stages/01_download_data.sh: ADReCS v3.3 files from bioinf.xmu.edu.cn/ADReCS (Xiamen University). No open/redistribution license is stated on the ADReCS site; it carries an 'All right reserved' copyright notice and requests citation. Therefore dcterms:license=UNSTATED and the class is restricted (a separate license/permission would be required to redistribute), prohibited for commercial (Merck) use. Additional restriction: ADReCS explicitly incorporates MedDRA terminology (proprietary, license-controlled by ICH/MSSO) and DrugBank content (whose academic license restricts commercial redistribution), so even absent an ADReCS-level license these embedded sources bar commercial redistribution. NOTE: a Database Commons/NGDC listing tags ADReCS metadata as 'CC0', but that appears to be a generic curator tag and is contradicted by the site's own 'All rights reserved' notice and the proprietary MedDRA content - do not rely on it. Reviewer should contact the ADReCS group (appo@xmu.edu.cn) for explicit terms and confirm MedDRA/DrugBank redistribution constraints before any commercial use.",
